### ============================================================
### GET CURRENT USER
### ============================================================

### Get current user - valid token
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### Get current user - missing token
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me


### Get current user - invalid token
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer this-is-not-a-valid-token


### Get current user - malformed authorization header
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: InvalidFormat {{accessToken}}
